<title>POLAND: Polish insurer Compensa to double share capital.</title>
<headline>Polish insurer Compensa to double share capital.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurer Compensa SA, in which Mostostal Export SA holds a 94.4 percent stake, plans to increase its share capital by 100 percent to 22 million zlotys, Mostostal said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Construction and trading company Mostostal said Compensa would issue 110,000 shares with a nominal value of 100 zlotys each. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
